DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you
	 purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \n\nOfficial 
	Tickets\nResale Tickets\n\nColum Tyrrell LIVE at Punch Line Comedy Club – 
	Sacramento\nIrish comedian Colum Tyrrell brings his sharp wit and engaging
	 storytelling to Punch Line Comedy Club in Sacramento on August 16\, 2026!
	 Known for his clever observations and unique comedic perspective\, Colum 
	Tyrrell delivers a stand-up show that will have you laughing all night lon
	g. \nEvent Details\nDate: Sunday\, August 16\, 2026\nTime: 7:00 PM (Doors 
	open at 6:00 PM)\nVenue: Punch Line Comedy Club – Sacramento\nAddress: 210
	0 Arden Way\, Sacramento\, CA 95825\nAge Requirement: 18+ with valid gover
	nment-issued photo ID\nBeverage Minimum: 2 beverages per person \nAbout Co
	lum Tyrrell\nColum Tyrrell is an Irish stand-up comedian known for his sha
	rp wit\, engaging storytelling\, and unique perspective on life. He has bu
	ilt a strong following through his relatable humor and has performed at co
	medy clubs and festivals across the US and internationally\, earning a rep
	utation as one of the most exciting voices in comedy today. \nWhat to Expe
	ct\n\nSharp wit and engaging storytelling\nUnique Irish perspective on eve
	ryday life\nClever observational comedy\nIntimate club atmosphere at Sacra
	mento’s premier comedy venue\nFull bar service with 2-beverage minimum\n\n
	Venue Information\nPunch Line Comedy Club – Sacramento is located at 2100 
	Arden Way in Sacramento\, CA. One of the top comedy clubs in Northern Cali
	fornia\, it features a full bar\, great sightlines\, and ample free parkin
	g in the shopping center lot. \nTicket Information\nTickets start from $32
	. This is an 18+ event with a 2-beverage minimum per person. Tickets are a
	vailable through Ticketmaster (official) or VividSeats (resale). \n\nOffic
	ial Tickets\nResale Tickets\n\nThis post contains affiliate links. We earn
	 a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost t
	o you. \nAll sales are final. Show times subject to change. Valid photo ID
	 may be required for entry.\n\nhttps://comedycalendar.com/event/colum-tyrr
	ell-live-at-punch-line-comedy-club-sacramento/\n\nFrom Comedy Calendar
