SUMMARY:Sunset Sundays Comedy Show at Upper Eastside Hangout
DTSTAMP:20260816T033416Z
DTSTART:20260816T200000Z
DESCRIPTION:Make the weekends last longer. Laugh during the Miami sunset wi
	th top comedians\, craft drinks\, food trucks\, and a neighborhood hangout
	 vibe.\n\n\nA New Sunday Night Comedy Experience in Miami \nMiami Comedy i
	s back on Sunday nights with the Biscuit Boyz comedy duo. \nJoin Miami’s B
	est Comedian\, Manny Garavito (as voted by Miami New Times)\, alongside Br
	ian G\, one of the most booked and in-demand comedians in South Florida\, 
	for a brand-new weekly comedy show at Upper East Side Hangout. \nManny and
	 Brian have been working together for years and have a dynamic comedy styl
	e that includes crowdwork\, storytelling\, riffing\, and basically anythin
	g you throw at them. \nPerfect event for: \n\nBirthdays\nLocals looking fo
	r a neighborhood hang out spot\nVisitors looking to find where the locals 
	hang out \nDate Night\nFamily Time\n…and anyone looking to make Sunday nig
	hts stand out during your weekend.\n\nLocated in one of Miami’s fastest-gr
	owing neighborhoods\, Upper East Side Hangout is exactly the kind of venue
	 Miami needs more of. A laid-back outdoor gathering space.  \nFeaturing:\n
	\nCraft cocktails\nCold beers\nFood trucks\nPicnic tables \nHigh-top seati
	ng \n…and an atmosphere designed for people who actually want to enjoy whe
	re they’re spending their evening.\n\nSunset Sundays isn’t your typical co
	medy show experience. \nThis show was built for foodies\, friends\, famili
	es\, locals\, visitors\, and anyone looking for a better way to end the we
	ekend.  \n \nFree Event For All \n \nVenue\nUpper East Side Hangout701 NE 
	79th StMiami\, FL 33138 \n \nFood Trucks:\n\nCheeseburger Baby\nNoodle Bar
	 Hand Pulled Noodles\nProfessor Snacks Exotic Snacks\nTacomiendo Tacos\n\n
	https://comedycalendar.com/event/sunset-sundays-comedy-show-at-upper-easts
	ide-hangout-7/\n\nFrom Comedy Calendar
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/sunset-sundays-comedy-show-at-upper-ea
	stside-hangout-7/
LOCATION:Upper Eastside Hangout\, Northeast 79th Street 701\, Miami\, FL\, 
	33138\, United States
