	al following through his appearances at top comedy clubs and festivals. Dr
	ew’s comedy blends personal anecdotes with sharp cultural observations tha
	t resonate with audiences everywhere. \nWhat to Expect\n\nHeadlining stand
	-up set by Drew Thomas\nSpecial appearance by Brad Garrett\nIntimate showr
	oom setting inside MGM Grand\nSharp\, observational stand-up comedy\n18+ s
