SUMMARY:Nick Alex LIVE at Cobb's Comedy Club
DTSTAMP:20260816T033416Z
DTSTART:20260819T193000Z
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nAbout the Performer\nNick Alex
	 is a rising stand-up comedian making a name for himself on the national c
	omedy circuit with his sharp\, observational humor and confident stage pre
	sence. Known for his clever writing and relatable material\, Nick Alex has
	 been building a loyal fanbase through relentless touring and standout per
	formances at top comedy clubs across the country. \nHis comedy style blend
	s smart observations with personal storytelling\, delivered with a natural
	 ease that makes even the most complex setups feel effortless. Whether rif
	fing on everyday life or diving into more personal territory\, Nick Alex c
	onsistently delivers laughs that resonate with audiences of all background
	s. \nThis one-night-only show at Cobb’s Comedy Club is a great opportunity
	 to catch a comedian on the rise before he’s selling out much bigger rooms
	. Don’t miss it. \nEvent Details\nDate: Wednesday\, August 19\, 2026\nTime
	: 7:30 PM PDT\nVenue: Cobb’s Comedy Club\, 915 Columbus Avenue\, San Franc
	isco\, CA 94133\nAge Restriction: 18+ / 2 Beverage Minimum\nTicket Price R
	ange: $28 – $52 \nAbout the Venue\nCobb’s Comedy Club is one of San Franci
	sco’s most iconic comedy venues\, located at 915 Columbus Avenue in the vi
	brant North Beach neighborhood. With a capacity of approximately 400 guest
	s\, Cobb’s offers an intimate setting where every seat delivers a great vi
	ew of the stage. \nThe club features a full bar and dining service\, with 
	cocktails\, beer\, wine\, and food available throughout the show. The clas
	sic comedy club layout — tables and chairs arranged around a central stage
	 — creates a warm\, communal atmosphere that amplifies every punchline. \n
	Cobb’s is easily accessible by BART and Muni\, and parking is available in
	 nearby garages throughout the North Beach area. It’s the perfect venue fo
	r a memorable night of stand-up comedy in San Francisco. \nWhat to Expect\
	nThis is a solo stand-up performance by Nick Alex — a full evening of his 
	signature observational comedy. Expect a well-crafted\, engaging set with 
	sharp writing and plenty of big laughs from start to finish. \nThe 18+ age
	 restriction and 2-beverage minimum are in effect. Doors open approximatel
	y 30–45 minutes before showtime. Arrive early to grab a great seat and set
	tle in with a drink before the show begins. \nTicket Information\nPrice Ra
	nge: $28 – $52 (before taxes and fees)\nTickets are available through Tick
	etmaster (official) and VividSeats (resale). \nOfficial TicketsResale Tick
	ets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We may earn a commission at no e
	xtra cost to you.\n\nhttps://comedycalendar.com/event/nick-alex-live-at-co
	bbs-comedy-club/\n\nFrom Comedy Calendar
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/nick-alex-live-at-cobbs-comedy-club/
LOCATION:Cobb’s Comedy Club\, 915 Columbus Avenue\, San Francisco\, Califor
	nia\, 94133\, United States Of America
