DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you
	 purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \n\nOfficial 
	Tickets\nResale Tickets\n\nDon McMillan 2.0 (Now Powered By AI) LIVE at Pu
	nch Line Comedy Club – Sacramento\nTech comedian Don McMillan brings his b
	rand-new show “Don McMillan 2.0 (Now Powered By AI)” to Punch Line Comedy 
	Club in Sacramento on August 19\, 2026! A former Silicon Valley engineer t
	urned stand-up comedian\, Don McMillan is famous for his hilarious PowerPo
	int presentations and tech-themed comedy that appeals to everyone. \nEvent
	 Details\nDate: Wednesday\, August 19\, 2026\nTime: 7:30 PM (Doors open at
	 6:30 PM)\nVenue: Punch Line Comedy Club – Sacramento\nAddress: 2100 Arden
	 Way\, Sacramento\, CA 95825\nAge Requirement: 18+ with valid government-i
	ssued photo ID\nBeverage Minimum: 2 beverages per person \nAbout Don McMil
	lan\nDon McMillan is a comedian and former engineer known for his clever t
	ech humor\, PowerPoint comedy\, and unique blend of engineering and stand-
	up. His viral videos and TV appearances have made him a fan favorite\, and
	 his new show “2.0 (Now Powered By AI)” takes his signature style to hilar
	ious new heights with fresh material about artificial intelligence and mod
	ern technology. \nWhat to Expect\n\nHilarious tech-themed stand-up comedy\
	nBrand-new AI-powered material from the 2.0 tour\nClever PowerPoint-style 
	comedy presentations\nRelatable humor for tech lovers and non-techies alik
	e\nIntimate club atmosphere at Sacramento’s premier comedy venue\nFull bar
	 service with 2-beverage minimum\n\nVenue Information\nPunch Line Comedy C
	lub – Sacramento is located at 2100 Arden Way in Sacramento\, CA. One of t
	he top comedy clubs in Northern California\, it features a full bar\, grea
	t sightlines\, and ample free parking in the shopping center lot. \nTicket
	 Information\nTickets start from $38. This is an 18+ event with a 2-bevera
	ge minimum per person. Tickets are available through Ticketmaster (officia
	l) or VividSeats (resale). \n\nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets\n\nThis po
	st contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets 
	through our links at no extra cost to you. \nAll sales are final. Show tim
	es subject to change. Valid photo ID may be required for entry.\n\nhttps:/
	/comedycalendar.com/event/don-mcmillan-live-at-punch-line-comedy-club-sacr
	amento/\n\nFrom Comedy Calendar
